      "content": "SP 80 SE             GREAT AND LITTLE HAMPDEN     LITTLE HAMPDEN 6/51                                              Barn to N.E. of farmyard                                                   at Manor Farm (formerly 21.6.55                                           listed under Manor Farmhouse                                                   and Barns) GV                                                II Barn.  Dated 1 D 174(?)5 on beam.  Timber frame with C20 weatherboard cladding, brick plinth, old tile roof.  5 bays.  Side to road has central cart entry. Narrow lean-to with board door opposite; deeper lean-to with open bay and stable door to left.  Queen strut trusses, large rough braces to tie beams. Listing NGR: SP8606503624"
    }
